Grammar

Rule 0     S' -> command
Rule 1     command -> action COORDINATE
Rule 2     command -> COMENZAR
Rule 3     command -> TABLERO bando
Rule 4     command -> CAMBIO
Rule 5     command -> AYUDA
Rule 6     action -> ATACAR
Rule 7     action -> DEFENDER
Rule 8     action -> ESCANEAR
Rule 9     bando -> PROPIO
Rule 10    bando -> ENEMIGO

Terminals, with rules where they appear

ATACAR               : 6
AYUDA                : 5
CAMBIO               : 4
COMENZAR             : 2
COORDINATE           : 1
DEFENDER             : 7
ENEMIGO              : 10
ESCANEAR             : 8
PROPIO               : 9
TABLERO              : 3
error                : 

Nonterminals, with rules where they appear

action               : 1
bando                : 3
command              : 0

Parsing method: LALR

state 0

    (0) S' -> . command
    (1) command -> . action COORDINATE
    (2) command -> . COMENZAR
    (3) command -> . TABLERO bando
    (4) command -> . CAMBIO
    (5) command -> . AYUDA
    (6) action -> . ATACAR
    (7) action -> . DEFENDER
    (8) action -> . ESCANEAR

    COMENZAR        shift and go to state 3
    TABLERO         shift and go to state 4
    CAMBIO          shift and go to state 5
    AYUDA           shift and go to state 6
    ATACAR          shift and go to state 7
    DEFENDER        shift and go to state 8
    ESCANEAR        shift and go to state 9

    command                        shift and go to state 1
    action                         shift and go to state 2

state 1

    (0) S' -> command .



state 2

    (1) command -> action . COORDINATE

